OL,3,ATrump's peace envoys to visit Moscow
OL,4,Aand Kyiv over weekend, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators Steve Witkoff and Jared
OL,7,FKushner will visit Russia and Ukraine
OL,8,Fthis weekend, reports say, as efforts
OL,9,Fto end the war appear to be gathering
OL,10,Fpace.
OL,12,FThe envoys will meet Russian President
OL,13,FVladimir Putin on Saturday in Moscow,
OL,14,Fand then will hold talks with Ukraine's
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky on Sunday in Kyiv,
OL,16,FAxios said, citing US officials.
OL,18,FWitkoff and Kushner have led US
OL,19,FPresident Donald Trump's efforts to
OL,20,Fbroker a peace deal, but a gulf remains
OL,21,Fbetween the two warring sides.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
